            "body": "The `1, 2` versions aren't currently optimized into vectorcall (because it's assuming that having the tuple literal pre-evaluated is better I think).\n\nSo I added the versions without the positional args which do actually test the relevant code-paths. But it stilll seem worth testing both with and without.",
